++++- prompt.md (this exact prompt)
++++- commands.log (commands + key stdout/stderr; preserve errors)
++++- diff.patch (git diff or git show)
++++- artifacts.json (paths + descriptions)
++++- external_facts.md (ONLY if you use web search)
++++Additionally create:
