+++
+++Last updated: 2025-12-20  
+++Scope (HARD): INX / INXU / NASDAQ100 / NASDAQ100U ladders ONLY (hourly + daily close).  
+++Data source (HARD): Polygon (Indices Advanced + Stocks Advanced) via REST + WebSocket.  
