++## Ticket #1 — Index-only GO/NO-GO gates (decouple from macro feed staleness)
++Goal (1 sentence):
++- Make index runs evaluate ONLY index-relevant quality/freshness/calibration gates, and stop blocking on unrelated macro feeds.
